WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Do I have to tell Garvin the bad news?

00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:04.944
on his birthday.

00:00:05.888 --> 00:00:08.728
Are you out of your mind? You want half a million?

00:00:08.832 --> 00:00:11.332
My boyfriend's project needs investment.

00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:14.776
The 500,000 is the inheritance my mother left me.

00:00:17.664 --> 00:00:20.664
Your money has already been spent by me.

00:00:20.608 --> 00:00:23.448
(water running)

00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:26.552
Not even a penny you shall receive. Now get lost.

00:00:32.384 --> 00:00:35.384
>> Mr. Rodriguez has been

00:00:35.328 --> 00:00:37.328
anticipating you.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.900
(typing)

00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:47.944
Bye-bye.

00:00:52.992 --> 00:00:55.792
You're late. I'll spank you.
